108 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 88 0 R
/T (One of us lies is a browser-based, single-player social-deduction game set on a fictional campus of the Asian University for Women \(AUW\). The player is one of ten students, each representing a home country, and must either complete campus missions as a Crewmate or sabotage the campus as the Impostor.The game runs in the browser in both offline solo and online modes, built with HTML, CSS and vanilla JavaScript on the Canvas 2D API. It combines nine educational mini-game missions, nine AI-controlled students, five hidden clues, emergency meetings with voting, and different look with day and night themes.)
/E (One of us lies is a browser-based, single-player social-deduction game set on a fictional campus of the Asian University for Women \(AUW\). The player is one of ten students, each representing a home country, and must either complete campus missions as a Crewmate or sabotage the campus as the Impostor.The game runs in the browser in both offline solo and online modes, built with HTML, CSS and vanilla JavaScript on the Canvas 2D API. It combines nine educational mini-game missions, nine AI-controlled students, five hidden clues, emergency meetings with voting, and different look with day and night themes.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
