115 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (The game opens with an Emergency Security Alert: an unknown intruder has breached the AUW campus with suspected sabotage intentions. Students are told to stay alert, complete their campus missions and report suspicious activity immediately.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
116 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (The player then chooses a home country from the ten AUW student nations, customises a cartoon character, and picks a role. Crewmates move through the campus finishing missions and collecting clues while avoiding the disguised intruder. Impostors eliminate students, use vents, trigger campus blackouts and disguise themselves as other students.The idea blends the tension of social-deduction games with AUW's own identity: the map is built from campus spaces \(residential hall, library, science lab, health centre, cafeteria, IT lab, courtyard, auditorium and security hub\), and every character carries a national flag to celebrate the diversity of the student body.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
